[00:00.67]1. As Jehovah’s people sound throughout the earth
[00:06.91]Truths about the Kingdom and its priceless worth,
[00:12.91]Theocratic order they must all obey
[00:21.98]And remain united, loyalty display.
[00:23.55](Chorus)
[00:25.12]Loyal submission in recognition,
[00:31.12]This to our God we owe.
[00:37.72]He gives protection, tender affection,
[00:43.72]Loyalty to him we show.
[00:49.72]2. God provides his steward and his active force.
[00:56.59]These will ever guide us in our Christian course.
[01:02.19]So may we be steadfast, seeking God to please,
[01:08.35]Loyally proclaiming all his wise decrees!
[01:10.75](Chorus)
[01:13.15]Loyal submission in recognition,
[01:15.55]This to our God we owe.
[01:26.97]He gives protection, tender affection,
